{"time": 1755440519, "type": "recv", "message_id": "276535064", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "964141319", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（码头没人！码头走了！）"}
{"time": 1755440582, "type": "recv", "message_id": "199601797", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "964141319", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“emmm，不如就叫你安安吧...我的姐姐也是这个名字，这样我可能也会更安心一点”"}
{"time": 1755440759, "type": "recv", "message_id": "704493880", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "964141319", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=199601797]\"...安安?\"点点头，\"嗯...\""}
